---
import Icon from './Icon.astro';
import { withBase } from '../lib/url';
---

<section class="selected-work" id="work" aria-labelledby="work-title">
  <header class="work-intro">
    <h2 id="work-title">Selected engineering work</h2>
    <a class="text-link" href={withBase('/latest.html')}>Full experience <Icon name="arrow-up-right" size={17} /></a>
  </header>

  <div class="work-spread">
    <article class="work-entry" aria-labelledby="execution-title">
      <p class="work-context">Microsoft / 2022 to present</p>
      <h3 id="execution-title">Running and evaluating PowerPoint agents</h3>
      <p class="work-summary">On the PowerPoint team, I scaled agent execution to thousands of concurrent containers. I also designed parallel evaluations with configurable models and datasets. My published résumé reports a <strong>4.6x reduction in evaluation time</strong>; the benchmark methodology is not public.</p>
      <a class="text-link" href={withBase('/latest.html#work')}>PowerPoint experience <Icon name="arrow-up-right" size={16} /></a>
    </article>
    <article class="work-entry" aria-labelledby="storage-title">
      <p class="work-context">VMware / 2020 to 2022</p>
      <h3 id="storage-title">Metadata repair and crash recovery in vSAN</h3>
      <p class="work-summary">A valid B+ tree can still disagree with an allocation bitmap. I led the design of vSAN's filesystem checker infrastructure to find and repair inconsistencies across metadata structures. For snapshot recovery, I implemented replay of committed writes from persisted logs.</p>
      <a class="text-link" href="https://patents.google.com/patent/US11573860B1" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Snapshot verification patent <Icon name="arrow-up-right" size={16} /></a>
    </article>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .selected-work { width: var(--content); margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 0 56px; border-top: 1px solid var(--line-strong); }
  .work-intro { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0 20px; padding: 24px 0 12px; }
  h2 { font-family: var(--display); font-size: 30px; line-height: 1.2; font-weight: 580; }
  .text-link { display: inline-flex; gap: 12px; align-items: center; min-height: 44px; color: var(--accent-strong); text-underline-offset: 5px; font-size: 16px; }
  .text-link :global(svg) { flex-shrink: 0; }
  .work-spread { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: var(--grid-gap); }
  .work-entry { padding-top: 18px; border-top: 1px solid var(--line-strong); }
  .work-context { color: var(--ink-soft); font-size: 15px; }
  h3 { margin-top: 10px; font: 560 28px/1.18 var(--display); max-width: 28ch; }
  .work-summary { margin: 12px 0 4px; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.5; max-width: 58ch; }
  @media (max-width: 700px) {
    .selected-work { padding-bottom: 48px; }
    .work-spread { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr); gap: 16px; }
    h2 { font-size: 20px; }
    h3 { font-size: 26px; }
  }
</style>